     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Hi all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">New option <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">queue_size_strict</code> for <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">add_resource</code>. By default, the behaviour does not change. But <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">queue_size_strict=TRUE</code> guarantees that <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">queue_size</code> is not exceeded with preemption enabled (see <a href=\"https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/issues/59\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/r-simmer/simmer/issues/59&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467991087000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0OPRiD3UIVTCEy3KHAq1sP\">#59</a>).</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">Regards,</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:SGkgYWxsLDxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+TmV3IG9wdGlvbiBgcXVldWVfc2l6ZV9zdHJpY3Rg\r\nIGZvciBgYWRkX3Jlc291cmNlYC4gQnkgZGVmYXVsdCwgdGhlIGJlaGF2aW91ciBkb2VzIG5vdCBj\r\naGFuZ2UuIEJ1dCBgcXVldWVfc2l6ZV9zdHJpY3Q9VFJVRWAgZ3VhcmFudGVlcyB0aGF0IGBxdWV1\r\nZV9zaXplYCBpcyBub3QgZXhjZWVkZWQgd2l0aCBwcmVlbXB0aW9uIGVuYWJsZWQgKHN